a725786","RawContent":"Question: What wedding package are you using at Excellence. Im not particular fond of many of the food choices between the silver or gold package. I&#039;m currently taking the gold package but I was wonderin what everyone else is considering? \n \n Lauren","Attachments":[],"Id":554203,"PostDate":1231470714,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Question: What wedding package are you using at Excellence. Im not particular fond of many of the food choices between the silver or gold package. I'm currently taking the gold package but I was wonderin what everyone else is considering? <br \/> <br \/> Lauren\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png<\/a><br><span>[\/CENTER]<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"reeveswedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1219377984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211327.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"reevesbride","Id":211327,"Name":"reevesbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"57079d6db87f140131d6452cf17675fa","RawContent":"Hey Ladies, \n \n I was checking out excellence on trip advisor and came across someone who was married there in December. They posted a link to there wedding photos in their review of the resort. &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/http:\/\/www.jillandsteveinmexico.com\/\"&gt;http:\/\/http:\/\/www.jillandsteveinmexico.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n \n check it out it answered many of my questions visually. Hope it helps!\n \n Lauren","Attachments":[],"Id":556240,"PostDate":1231631144,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey Ladies, <br \/> <br \/> I was checking out excellence on trip advisor and came across someone who was married there in December. They posted a link to there wedding photos in their review of the resort. <a href='http:\/\/http:\/\/www.jillandsteveinmexico.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/http:\/\/www.ji...veinmexico.com\/<\/a><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> check it out it answered many of my questions visually. Hope it helps!<br \/> <br \/> Lauren\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png<\/a><br><span>[\/CENTER]<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"reeveswedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":