 your decison Meista im glad you are getting exactly what you wanted. \n \n Lauren","Attachments":[],"Id":582736,"PostDate":1233803562,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Sensatori Bride<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi Ladies! <br \/> <br \/> So I am now getting married at this resort and am totally excited! This is my 3rd and final switch! I will be married on May14, 2009. So we're just a little over 3 months away!<br \/> <br \/> Happy Planning!<br \/> ~M<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Congrats on your decison Meista im glad you are getting exactly what you wanted. <br \/> <br \/> Lauren\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png<\/a><br><span>[\/CENTER]<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"reeveswedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1219377984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211327.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"reevesbride","Id":211327,"Name":"reevesbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"37fd505bfba8f228fd12c1616f36afc1","RawContent":"How soon did you guys get information about the resort\/wedding after booking with you travel agent? (I just feel like the website is so vague and I feel bad for asking our family and close friends to travel)\n I&#039;m sorry I know you guys have posted wedding info, but I just don&#039;t have enough points to open them so I was just going to wait until they send it out to me. It&#039;s been a month now and I&#039;m just feeling a little nervous. I really love the place, I just don&#039;t know who&#039;s being unreliable (whether it&#039;s EPM or my travel agent).\n How soon did you guys book the place and how soon did you get in touch with the wedding coordinator? And do you recommend a good travel agent?","Attachments":[],"Id":582838,"PostDate":1233808629,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                How soon did you guys get information about the resort\/wedding after booking with you travel agent? (I just feel like the website is so vague and I feel bad for asking our family and close friends to travel)<br \/> I'm sorry I know you guys have posted wedding info, but I just don't have enough points to open them so I was just going to wait until they send it out to me. It's been a month now and I'm just feeling a little nervous. I really love the place, I just don't know who's being unreliable (whether it's EPM or my travel agent).<br \/> How soon did you guys book the place and how soon did you get in touch with the wedding coordinator? And do you recommend a good travel agent?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Jodi826@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1230868125,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213481.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jodi826","Id":213481,"Name":"jodi826","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2876,"TotalPages":288,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":2870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
