lspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Sensatori Bride<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">My dress finally came today!! OMG it took forever. I'm going to try it on at 9:30am first thing in the morning! I am soooo excited.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Take pictures!!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i30.photobucket.com\/albums\/c336\/dmbstolio\/Dec122009238-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i30.photobucket.com\/albums\/c3...22009238-1.jpg<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.jenandken2009.com\">www.jenandken2009.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20091212\/e\/Jen+%26amp%3B+Kenny%27s+wedding\/k\/02c3\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...02c3\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"davis1974@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1215061237,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210302.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":98,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jennifer Davis","Id":210302,"Name":"Jennifer Davis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ed45b1b53bb2b431cdabe0b1d7c8644b","RawContent":"Hello ladies, \n \n I haven&#039;t seen one post from a guy so far but no worries though. I guess women are just better planners. Anyways, my fiance &amp;amp; I are thinking about having our wedding here at the Excellence Resort and I just wanted to get some thoughts on the matter. I&#039;ve emailed the company about pricing but haven&#039;t heard back yet. Does anyone know if they&#039;ll offer bulk pricing if we bring 50+ people to the hotel with us? Summer 2010! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":659913,"PostDate":1240168200,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello ladies, <br \/> <br \/> I haven't seen one post from a guy so far but no worries though. I guess women are just better planners. Anyways, my fiance & I are thinking about having our wedding here at the Excellence Resort and I just wanted to get some thoughts on the matter. I've emailed the company about pricing but haven't heard back yet. Does anyone know if they'll offer bulk pricing if we bring 50+ people to the hotel with us? Summer 2010! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"oldhamk31@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1240084383,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216815.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":113,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"keitholdham","Id":216815,"Name":"keitholdham","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"627f2f3d47185ff3a9cd2cb85c6dc2c6","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;keitholdham&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hello ladies, \n \n I haven&#039;t seen one post from a guy so far but no worries though. I guess women are just better planners. Anyways, my fiance &amp;amp; I are thinking about having our wedding here at the Excellence Resort and I just wanted to get some thoughts on the matter. I&#039;ve emailed the company about pricing but haven&#039;t heard back yet. Does anyone know if they&#039;ll offer bulk pricing if we bring 50+ people to the hotel with us? Summer 2010! :)&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;\n The wedding packages and associated prices are listed on the excellence webiste: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.excellence-resorts.com\"&gt;Excellence Group Resorts&lt;\/a&gt;.\n \n You may want to contact a travel agent to get you group rates since you are going to need 25 rooms. There are a bunch of great travel agents on this site if you are looking for one.\n \n P.S. There are a few guys posting on the board, so you are not alone! In any event, welcome! You&#039;ll find all the information you need here for your wedding. It&#039;s nice to see the FI taking interest in the wedding planning.","Attachments":[],"Id":659996,"PostDate":1240172766,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>keitholdham<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hello ladies, <br \/> <br \/> I haven't seen one post from a guy so far but no worries though. I guess women are just better planners. Anyways, my fiance & I are thinking about having our wedding here at the Excellence Resort and I just wanted to get some thoughts on the matter. I've emailed the company about pricing but haven't heard back yet. Does anyone know if they'll offer bulk pricing if we bring 50+ people to the hotel with us? Summer 2010! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> The wedding packages and associated prices are listed on the excellence webiste: <a href='http:\/\/www.excellence-resorts.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Excellence Group Resorts<\/a>.<br \/> <br \/> You may want to contact a travel agent to get you group rates since you are going to need 25 rooms. There are a bunch of great travel agents on this site if you are looking for one.<br \/> <br \/> P.S. There are a few guys posting on the board, so you are not alone! In any event, welcome! You'll find all the information you need here for your wedding. It's nice to see the FI taking interest in the wedding planning.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i30.photobucket.com\/albums\/c336\/dmbstolio\/Dec122009238-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i30.photobucket.com\/albums\/c3...22009238-1.jpg<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.jenandken2009.com\">www.jenandken2009.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20091212\/e\/Jen+%26amp%3B+Kenny%27s+wedding\/k\/02c3\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...02c3\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"davis1974@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1215061237,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210302.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":98,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jennifer Davis","Id":210302,"Name":"Jennifer Davis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5b4020dcb75201ff83d9b0c1d0a82e96","RawContent":"My dress as well as my bridesmaids dresses came in and I was able to preview them both. My wedding dress I totally love, I didn&#039;t even want to take it off. \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/","Attachments":[],"Id":660334,"PostDate":1240198058,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My dress as well as my bridesmaids dresses came in and I was able to preview them both. My wedding dress I totally love, I didn't even want to take it off. <br \/>\n <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/http:\/\/i710.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww108\/Reeveswedding\/ShansPics060.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/>\n <br \/>\n My bridesmaids dresses I had some issues with. The dresses were not all cut from the same dye lot. So one of the 4 dresses is a little darker then the rest. Its noticable but not so noticable, that I wanted to send them all back and risk not recieving the dresses in time. <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/http:\/\/i710.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww108\/Reeveswedding\/ShansPics049.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/>\n Here's their dress one of my bridesmaids is modeling. <br \/>\n I also had my first hair trial ( im not really crazy about the hair)<br \/>\n <br \/>\n <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i710.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww108\/Reeveswedding\/ShansPics051.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/>\n <br \/>\n <br \/>\n Just wanted to share my updates hope the photos posted correctly!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png<\/a><br><span>[\/CENTER]<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"reeveswedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1219377984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211327.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"reevesbride","Id":211327,"Name":"reevesbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0258919ac4c6cd6b25402a68cb7106c0","RawContent":"Sorry Two of my pics didn&#039;t post\n Bridesmaid\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i710.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww108\/Reeveswedding\/ShansPics049.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n My Dress \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i710.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww108\/Reeveswedding\/ShansPics060.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":660340,"PostDate":1240198238,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Sorry Two of my pics didn't post<br \/> Bridesmaid<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i710.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww108\/Reeveswedding\/ShansPics049.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> My Dress <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i710.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww108\/Reeveswedding\/ShansPics060.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png<\/a><br><span>[\/CENTER]<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"reeveswedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1219377984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211327.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"reevesbride","Id":211327,"Name":"reevesbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a344227e44903b1bb6333c1e4a0b38c2","RawContent":"OMG! I almost decided to pick the same bridesmaids dresses and you look so pretty in your dress!\n \n I went for my first fitting. I didnt take any pictures but I LOVE my dress! I thought it was going to be too small but it was actually too big. Bootcamp definitely helps! The only bad thing is that i am having to pay $400 in alterations.","Attachments":[],"Id":660345,"PostDate":1240198741,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                OMG! I almost decided to pick the same bridesmaids dresses and you look so pretty in your dress!<br \/> <br \/> I went for my first fitting. I didnt take any pictures but I LOVE my dress! I thought it was going to be too small but it was actually too big. Bootcamp definitely helps! The only bad thing is that i am having to pay $400 in alterations.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Mesita and Durante<\/span><br><span>June 18, 2009<\/span><br><span>Excellence Playa Mujeres<\/span><br><br><span>My wedding review:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t45032#post857892\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...032#post857892<\/a><span>My wedding pro slideshow:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita\">http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/192\/20090618\/Our+Swine+Flu+Free+Wedding%21\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/1...%21\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mesita.simms@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1221110745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211672.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sensatori Bride","Id":211672,"Name":"Sensatori Bride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e8982ab970172d31334fd9a7f62f79af","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Sensatori Bride&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;OMG! I almost decided to pick the same bridesmaids dresses and you look so pretty in your dress!\n \n I went for my first fitting. I didnt take any pictures but I LOVE my dress! I thought it was going to be too small but it was actually too big. Bootcamp definitely helps! The only bad thing is that i am having to pay $400 in alterations.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I&#039;m so happy you got your dress and love it. Im sure we&#039;ll see pic&#039;s soon with your wedding being less then a month away. My alterations were included with the cost of the dress and truely weren&#039;t overpriced considering I found my dress online for like $90.00 cheaper at the bridal store. $400.00 I would have had a stroke. I really didnt need any alterations she actually only had to put two pins in at the bustline and a bustle.","Attachments":[],"Id":660350,"PostDate":1240199183,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Sensatori Bride<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">OMG! I almost decided to pick the same bridesmaids dresses and you look so pretty in your dress!<br \/> <br \/> I went for my first fitting. I didnt take any pictures but I LOVE my dress! I thought it was going to be too small but it was actually too big. Bootcamp definitely helps! The only bad thing is that i am having to pay $400 in alterations.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I'm so happy you got your dress and love it. Im sure we'll see pic's soon with your wedding being less then a month away. My alterations were included with the cost of the dress and truely weren't overpriced considering I found my dress online for like $90.00 cheaper at the bridal store. $400.00 I would have had a stroke. I really didnt need any alterations she actually only had to put two pins in at the bustline and a bustle.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png<\/a><br><span>[\/CENTER]<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"reeveswedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1219377984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211327.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"reevesbride","Id":211327,"Name":"reevesbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2ad5402a3da4767d97bfc3531cd41593","RawContent":"Lauren,\n \n I LOVE your dress! It&#039;s gorgeous!\n \n I get so excited posting on this thread with you ladies and my wedding is still 8 months away!","Attachments":[],"Id":660396,"PostDate":1240201844,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Lauren,<br \/> <br \/> I LOVE your dress! It's gorgeous!<br \/> <br \/> I get so excited posting on this thread with you ladies and my wedding is still 8 months away!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i30.photobucket.com\/albums\/c336\/dmbstolio\/Dec122009238-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i30.photobucket.com\/albums\/c3...22009238-1.jpg<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.jenandken2009.com\">www.jenandken2009.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20091212\/e\/Jen+%26amp%3B+Kenny%27s+wedding\/k\/02c3\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...02c3\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"davis1974@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1215061237,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210302.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":98,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jennifer Davis","Id":210302,"Name":"Jennifer Davis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d657c784526601fcacc5b48b7b4e7551","RawContent":"You guys I&#039;m sad today : (\n \n People are dropping like flies! When I first started planning I thought we would have about 50 guests. That turned into about 20 people who said they would go and now all of a sudden people can&#039;t make it and its just like 8 people!!! WTF! I wish that it was just the 2 of us. \n \n What fun is a wedding with only 8 people well 10 including us. I&#039;m starting to re-think whether or not I want to pay for the wedding package with just that many people going. Maybe I should just do the free package now...\n \n Well that&#039;s my vent for today...\n \n ~Mesita","Attachments":[],"Id":662758,"PostDate":1240352112,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                You guys I'm sad today : (<br \/> <br \/> People are dropping like flies! When I first started planning I thought we would have about 50 guests. That turned into about 20 people who said they would go and now all of a sudden people can't make it and its just like 8 people!!! WTF! I wish that it was just the 2 of us. <br \/> <br \/> What fun is a wedding with only 8 people well 10 including us. I'm starting to re-think whether or not I want to pay for the wedding package with just that many people going. Maybe I should just do the free package now...<br \/> <br \/> Well that's my vent for today...<br \/> <br \/> ~Mesita\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Mesita and Durante<\/span><br><span>June 18, 2009<\/span><br><span>Excellence Playa Mujeres<\/span><br><br><span>My wedding review:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t45032#post857892\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...032#post857892<\/a><span>My wedding pro slideshow:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita\">http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/192\/20090618\/Our+Swine+Flu+Free+Wedding%21\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/1...%21\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mesita.simms@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1221110745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211672.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sensatori Bride","Id":211672,"Name":"Sensatori Bride","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2876,"TotalPages":288,"CurrentPage":110,"NextPage":120,"PreviousPage":100,"LastPage":2870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
