t-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Sensatori Bride<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi Ladies!!!!!! I miss you guys!!! This place is absolutely breath taking! My wedding was the most beautiful day of my life and I had a great time! Yamina is great! She even did things that I didn't ask for free! So I know its a pain that she doesnt respond but there are a ton of weddings here everyday. She is very busy but very attentive once you're here. I will try to answer your questions when I get back.<br \/> <br \/> I noticed the posts about La Amada...it is a few feet away from building 8 so its a very good alternative. I met Yamina's boss too and she is nice. Well I gotta go but wanted to say hi. I'll post pics and a very detailed review when I get back home.<br \/> <br \/> ~Mesita<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Congratulations!<br \/> I am sooo happy for you!!!!!!!! Looking forward to your reviews. Its comforting to hear that it really does come together once your there. Have a safe trip back!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yoliejimenez1976@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1243020069,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217738.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jewels336","Id":217738,"Name":"Jewels336","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"01333f544806df7dbb8d7af4a5ce5c57","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Jewels336&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Thanks for the info Jenn! I appreciate it. Funny you should mention the day pass, this was one of the questions I just presented to Yamina. I needed clarification on which fee applied on the wedding day for guests\/vendors coming into the resort. \n \n Poor Yamina, I guess I can understand why she takes so long to return emails...&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;You are very welcome. I believe the following information is correct-\n \n Regular day pass fee = $100 for a half day or $150 for a full day\n Special event day pass fee (for weddings) = $70\n Vendor fee = $100 per person","Attachments":[],"Id":733381,"PostDate":1245723119,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Jewels336<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Thanks for the info Jenn! I appreciate it. Funny you should mention the day pass, this was one of the questions I just presented to Yamina. I needed clarification on which fee applied on the wedding day for guests\/vendors coming into the resort. <br \/> <br \/> Poor Yamina, I guess I can understand why she takes so long to return emails...<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>You are very welcome. I believe the following information is correct-<br \/> <br \/> Regular day pass fee = $100 for a half day or $150 for a full day<br \/> Special event day pass fee (for weddings) = $70<br \/> Vendor fee = $100 per person\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i30.photobucket.com\/albums\/c336\/dmbstolio\/Dec122009238-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i30.photobucket.com\/albums\/c3...22009238-1.jpg<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.jenandken2009.com\">www.jenandken2009.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20091212\/e\/Jen+%26amp%3B+Kenny%27s+wedding\/k\/02c3\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...02c3\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"davis1974@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1215061237,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210302.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":98,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName"