{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"96d08e723cb45aeef0bcd2ca31633fd9","RawContent":"Hi, thanks for the reply and help! We actually havent been able to lock down a date yet because the first two dates we requested in Nov 2010 were already booked, so now we have asked about the availability of 3 different dates in early 2011. Feels like it takes forever to get a response! Is that normal? \n \n As for the letter I did write one up that I hope to send with Save the Dates by late this year. If you want a copy i&#039;d be more than happy to send it. Just let me know. \n \n And of course, if you have an super helpful hints about planning at Playa Mujeres, please, please, please let me know. I am trying not to be stressed about the process at all! \n \n Good luck &amp;amp; happy planning. \n \n -Valerie","Attachments":[],"Id":887574,"PostDate":1255712713,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi, thanks for the reply and help! We actually havent been able to lock down a date yet because the first two dates we requested in Nov 2010 were already booked, so now we have asked about the availability of 3 different dates in early 2011. Feels like it takes forever to get a response! Is that normal? <br \/> <br \/> As for the letter I did write one up that I hope to send with Save the Dates by late this year. If you want a copy i'd be more than happy to send it. Just let me know. <br \/> <br \/> And of course, if you have an super helpful hints about planning at Playa Mujeres, please, please, please let me know. I am trying not to be stressed about the process at all! <br \/> <br \/> Good luck & happy planning. <br \/> <br \/> -Valerie\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"valeriefearns@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1254520310,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-222240.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ValerieandBrian2010","Id":222240,"Name":"ValerieandBrian2010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cd7bc6c52fef719d43ed87533f8f23e6","RawContent":"Hi Valerie, \n Congrats on your upcoming wedding. The one thing I can say to you about Excellence is its not a wedding mill, like some of the other resorts. They only have 2 weddings a day so if your dates aren&#039;t availible thats probably why. If your not totally against it consider a week day like thursday, for your wedding. Also Yamina is wonderful but not too quick on the email front. After getting married there last summer I understand why. Shes super busy and gives great attention to detail. She spent half the day getting things ready for my 6pm wedding and had a earlier wedding that day as well. So she usually checks email if she has time at the end of her day our early in the morning. But not to worry she&#039;ll take care of your every need as your wedding nears. \n \n Congrats again, \n Lauren \n \n &lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;ValerieandBrian2010&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hi, thanks for the reply and help! We actually havent been able to lock down a date yet because the first two dates we requested in Nov 2010 were already booked, so now we have asked about the availability of 3 different dates in early 2011. Feels like it takes forever to get a response! Is that normal? \n \n As for the letter I did write one up that I hope to send with Save the Dates by late this year. If you want a copy i&#039;d be more than happy to send it. Just let me know. \n \n And of course, if you have an super helpful hints about planning at Playa Mujeres, please, please, please let me know. I am trying not to be stressed about the process at all! \n \n Good luck &amp;amp; happy planning. \n \n -Valerie&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":889526,"PostDate":1255838863,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Valerie, <br \/> Congrats on your upcoming wedding. The one thing I can say to you about Excellence is its not a wedding mill, like some of the other resorts. They only have 2 weddings a day so if your dates aren't availible thats probably why. If your not totally against it consider a week day like thursday, for your wedding. Also Yamina is wonderful but not too quick on the email front. After getting married there last summer I understand why. Shes super busy and gives great attention to detail. She spent half the day getting things ready for my 6pm wedding and had a earlier wedding that day as well. So she usually checks email if she has time at the end of her day our early in the morning. But not to worry she'll take care of your every need as your wedding nears. <br \/> <br \/> Congrats again, <br \/> Lauren <br \/> <br \/> <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>ValerieandBrian2010<\/strong> <a href='\/forum\/post\/1025959' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/a>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi, thanks for the reply and help! We actually havent been able to lock down a date yet because the first two dates we requested in Nov 2010 were already booked, so now we have asked about the availability of 3 different dates in early 2011. Feels like it takes forever to get a response! Is that normal? <br \/> <br \/> As for the letter I did write one up that I hope to send with Save the Dates by late this year. If you want a copy i'd be more than happy to send it. Just let me know. <br \/> <br \/> And of course, if you have an super helpful hints about planning at Playa Mujeres, please, please, please let me know. I am trying not to be stressed about the process at all! <br \/> <br \/> Good luck & happy planning. <br \/> <br \/> -Valerie<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png<\/a><br><span>[\/CENTER]<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"reeveswedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1219377984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211327.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"reevesbride","Id":211327,"Name":"reevesbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e7c763e67a1889b962cb425861b0437c","RawContent":"Hi everyone. Im new to the forum and all you girls have been so helpful. I am planning a wedding for Oct 2010 but haven&#039;t booked yet...am I too late&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; I am so indecisive. I was hoping if anyone knows if EPM requires a certain percent of guests stay at the resort. Honestly I didn&#039;t want any guests, but my family won&#039;t let me get away with that. I just don&#039;t want anyone too close : P Thanks","Attachments":[],"Id":891564,"PostDate":1256018270,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone. Im new to the forum and all you girls have been so helpful. I am planning a wedding for Oct 2010 but haven't booked yet...am I too late<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> I am so indecisive. I was hoping if anyone knows if EPM requires a certain percent of guests stay at the resort. Honestly I didn't want any guests, but my family won't let me get away with that. I just don't want anyone too close : P Thanks\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"MACarusi@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1255974416,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-222709.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GracieLR","Id":222709,"Name":"GracieLR","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5a02bf5356b216dbc7186f230622f4b6","RawContent":"Ladies - Lately I&#039;ve been over indulging in WE TV. So here&#039;s my question (based on all the wedding shows I now subscribe to)...what did you absolutely have to take down to Mexico with you? I mean outside of you and your FI wedding attire. My wedding is in July but I&#039;m heading out of the country soon and won&#039;t be back before close to the wedding. I&#039;m trying to sort out as much stuff before I leave so I only have to order\/ship while I&#039;m away. So I&#039;m thinking favors, programs and menus, OOT bags and contents, gifts for the bridal party, any others? I know these are destinations weddings so I&#039;m hoping the stuff we have to haul down there with us will be minimal. \n \n GracieLR welcome. The ladies here are fab.","Attachments":[],"Id":891631,"PostDate":1256020677,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ladies - Lately I've been over indulging in WE TV. So here's my question (based on all the wedding shows I now subscribe to)...what did you absolutely have to take down to Mexico with you? I mean outside of you and your FI wedding attire. My wedding is in July but I'm heading out of the country soon and won't be back before close to the wedding. I'm trying to sort out as much stuff before I leave so I only have to order\/ship while I'm away. So I'm thinking favors, programs and menus, OOT bags and contents, gifts for the bridal party, any others? I know these are destinations weddings so I'm hoping the stuff we have to haul down there with us will be minimal. <br \/> <br \/> GracieLR welcome. The ladies here are fab.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aobassey@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1248805156,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219919.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"affiwin","Id":219919,"Name":"affiwin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"db776269511b05b1cd73c28c5214c563","RawContent":"Hey ladies... I need a bit of dress help. Did anyone order their dress online. I have tried on waaaay too many dresses and not found &amp;quot;the one&amp;quot; yet. But of course I see a ton of things I like online and in magazines. Just wondering if anyone went the online route. So far I have checked out Store of Brides and Peri dress...but I&#039;m chicken.","Attachments":[],"Id":906278,"PostDate":1256969485,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey ladies... I need a bit of dress help. Did anyone order their dress online. I have tried on waaaay too many dresses and not found \"the one\" yet. But of course I see a ton of things I like online and in magazines. Just wondering if anyone went the online route. So far I have checked out Store of Brides and Peri dress...but I'm chicken.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/1768\/20100522\/Until+I+Marry+My+Love\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/...ove\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tracihopeis@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238572485,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216339.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"thope","Id":216339,"Name":"thope","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"021bc18f1a9f89c75622c9026ab4a322","RawContent":"Hi ladies. I don&#039;t really have any input but since I have not posted in a while, I figured I would say, &amp;quot;hello&amp;quot;. My wedding is getting close. Went for my first dress fitting last weekend. Legal day is the 13th of November. Time is flying!","Attachments":[],"Id":906285,"PostDate":1256970134,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi ladies. I don't really have any input but since I have not posted in a while, I figured I would say, \"hello\". My wedding is getting close. Went for my first dress fitting last weekend. Legal day is the 13th of November. Time is flying!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i30.photobucket.com\/albums\/c336\/dmbstolio\/Dec122009238-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i30.photobucket.com\/albums\/c3...22009238-1.jpg<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.jenandken2009.com\">www.jenandken2009.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20091212\/e\/Jen+%26amp%3B+Kenny%27s+wedding\/k\/02c3\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...02c3\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"davis1974@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1215061237,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210302.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":98,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jennifer Davis","Id":210302,"Name":"Jennifer Davis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1bfb9d4ba373e614ffe769f937aeba6a","RawContent":"Hi EPM Brides!\n I&#039;m new to the forum and wanted to introduce myself! I&#039;ve read through all of the posts and have gotten a lot of great information!\n My fiance and I are getting married at EPM on March 5, 2010, so I don&#039;t have a whole lot of planning time!!!\n I am looking to send out a save the date\/informational packet in the next week or two and would LOVE to have some insight on the letter to include. I saw that several of you wrote one, but since I&#039;m new to the forum, I can&#039;t open them. Will you guys email me your letters? My email address is &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20100305\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ffbd\/event.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":919529,"PostDate":1257900335,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi EPM Brides!<br \/> I'm new to the forum and wanted to introduce myself! I've read through all of the posts and have gotten a lot of great information!<br \/> My fiance and I are getting married at EPM on March 5, 2010, so I don't have a whole lot of planning time!!!<br \/> I am looking to send out a save the date\/informational packet in the next week or two and would LOVE to have some insight on the letter to include. I saw that several of you wrote one, but since I'm new to the forum, I can't open them. Will you guys email me your letters? My email address is <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20100305\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ffbd\/event.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Rebecca and Clay<\/span><br><span>3-5-10<\/span><br><span>Excellence Playa Mujeres<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.rebeccaandclay.com\">www.rebeccaandclay.com<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"rah_3@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1257638541,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223137.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":26,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Rebecca030510","Id":223137,"Name":"Rebecca030510","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5cd39ef7c32ac062903a28df9830017a","RawContent":"Hi EPM Brides!\n I&#039;m new to the forum and wanted to introduce myself! I&#039;ve read through all of the posts and have gotten a lot of great information!\n My fiance and I are getting married at EPM on March 5, 2010, so I don&#039;t have a whole lot of planning time!!!\n I am looking to send out a save the date\/informational packet in the next week or two and would LOVE to have some insight on the letter to include. I saw that several of you wrote one, but since I&#039;m new to the forum, I can&#039;t open them. Will you guys email me your letters? My email address is &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20100305\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ffbd\/event.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":919582,"PostDate":1257902264,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi EPM Brides!<br \/> I'm new to the forum and wanted to introduce myself! I've read through all of the posts and have gotten a lot of great information!<br \/> My fiance and I are getting married at EPM on March 5, 2010, so I don't have a whole lot of planning time!!!<br \/> I am looking to send out a save the date\/informational packet in the next week or two and would LOVE to have some insight on the letter to include. I saw that several of you wrote one, but since I'm new to the forum, I can't open them. Will you guys email me your letters? My email address is <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20100305\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ffbd\/event.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Rebecca and Clay<\/span><br><span>3-5-10<\/span><br><span>Excellence Playa Mujeres<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.rebeccaandclay.com\">www.rebeccaandclay.com<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"rah_3@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1257638541,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223137.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":26,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Rebecca030510","Id":223137,"Name":"Rebecca030510","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"61e475d1d1fb78633221d1079245a8eb","RawContent":"Anyone doing a trash the dress session? I really want to do it right after the wedding but I am unsure if I should do it at EPM. There doesn&#039;t seem to be and waves and the seaweed issue may not be pleasant for that. Does anyone know of any other locations close by that would work? Thanks","Attachments":[],"Id":922939,"PostDate":1258075172,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Anyone doing a trash the dress session? I really want to do it right after the wedding but I am unsure if I should do it at EPM. There doesn't seem to be and waves and the seaweed issue may not be pleasant for that. Does anyone know of any other locations close by that would work? Thanks\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"MACarusi@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1255974416,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-222709.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GracieLR","Id":222709,"Name":"GracieLR","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"58c69c553ed0124740bf6fd6ba31eefd","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;GracieLR&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Anyone doing a trash the dress session? I really want to do it right after the wedding but I am unsure if I should do it at EPM. There doesn&#039;t seem to be and waves and the seaweed issue may not be pleasant for that. Does anyone know of any other locations close by that would work? Thanks&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Waves and seaweed issue? Did I miss something? Why not head to Isla Mujeres for your TTD if you have time. It&#039;s a small fishing island not far from Playa Mujeres and would make an interesting backdrop. I&#039;ve been there and the beaches are amazing.","Attachments":[],"Id":923663,"PostDate":1258105494,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>GracieLR<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Anyone doing a trash the dress session? I really want to do it right after the wedding but I am unsure if I should do it at EPM. There doesn't seem to be and waves and the seaweed issue may not be pleasant for that. Does anyone know of any other locations close by that would work? Thanks<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Waves and seaweed issue? Did I miss something? Why not head to Isla Mujeres for your TTD if you have time. It's a small fishing island not far from Playa Mujeres and would make an interesting backdrop. I've been there and the beaches are amazing.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aobassey@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1248805156,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219919.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"affiwin","Id":219919,"Name":"affiwin","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2876,"TotalPages":288,"CurrentPage":320,"NextPage":330,"PreviousPage":310,"LastPage":2870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
